
<!-- ================= TOP SECTION ================= -->
<section class="container py-5 text-center">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <h1 class="display-4  mb-4">
      Smile in 5 months
    </h1>

    <p class="lead leadtext mb-4">
      At Redhead Orthodontics, we have designed the ultimate Smile in 5 months programme using a simple invisible lingual hidden brace or a clear aligner system. 
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      So if you are looking for a fast, comfortable, aesthetically-pleasing way to straighten your teeth, then Smile in 5 months could be for you.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= HERO IMAGE ================= -->
<div class="treatment-hero-fullwidth">
  <%= image_tag "treatments/redhead-smile-in-six-months-web.jpg",
      class: "treatment-hero-img",
      alt: "Smile in 5 months" %>
</div>

<!-- ================= CONTENT SECTION 1 ================= -->
<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-center">
      What is a 5 month Brace Treatment?
    </h3>

    <p>
      Redheads Smile in 5 months Treatment is a braces system that straightens just the teeth in your smile. 
    </p>

    <p>
      Being hidden behind the front teeth the system is different from fixed metal braces, so nobody knows you are wearing a brace; they are invisible.
    </p>

    <p>
      Smile in 5 months can be an ideal treatment to correct protruding teeth, close space in between teeth, straighten crooked or overlapping teeth, (e.g. overbites, underbites, crossbites or open bites).
    </p>

    <p>
      As the main advantage of Smile in 5 months is the speed at which these braces work, they are ideal if you want to get your teeth straightened before a special occasion such as a wedding.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= COST SECTION ================= -->
<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-center">
      How much will Smile in 5 months treatment cost me?
    </h3>

    <p>
      The cost of Smile in 5 months Treatment varies from case to case. On average, the price for the treatment ranges from between £2000 to £2500.
    </p>

    <p>
      The aim of contemporary orthodontic treatment is fast treatment progress.
    </p>

    <p>
      With invisible lingual brackets, nobody will be able to tell that you are undergoing orthodontic treatment as they are perfectly hidden.
    </p>

    <p>
      Beautiful teeth right from the beginning These lingual brackets have a much lower profile compared to other lingual brackets.
    </p>

    <p>
      They will cause hardly any irritation or speech impediment and will show the treatment progress right from the beginning.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= ALIGNER SECTION ================= -->
<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <p>
      If you don’t like fixed braces, then another option is to try simply 5 clear removable aligners.
    </p>

    <p>
      Simply 5 aligners and a Smile in 10 weeks
    </p>

    <p>
      Redhead employs a clear aligner system that you can change yourself every two weeks and with each new aligner – your teeth become straighter. The average cost of this type of treatment is between £2000 – £2500.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

